WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.171 --> 00:00:14.252
had to find out what Mr.

2
00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.193
Presto was up to.

3
00:00:15.213 --> 00:00:20.177
"Hey, guys," she said to her friends.

4
00:00:20.198 --> 00:00:24.722
"I just remembered I have to help my mom with chores.

5
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:26.484
I'll be back soon."

6
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.181
Roxy found Detective Smith at the TV station.

7
00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:39.883
He was looking at some equipment.

8
00:00:39.903 --> 00:00:43.125
"Where's Mr.

9
00:00:43.185 --> 00:00:44.746
Presto?" Roxy asked.

10
00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:48.088
"I don't know," said the detective.

11
00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:50.570
"He was gone before I got here."

12
00:00:52.491 --> 00:00:53.271
Roxy smirked.

13
00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:56.753
"I'm surprised Mighty Man didn't stop him."

14
00:00:56.773 --> 00:01:01.036
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

15
00:01:02.196 --> 00:01:05.358
"Mighty Man isn't a real superhero like you, Rocket Girl."

16
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.081
"We need to find out what Mr.

17
00:01:09.121 --> 00:01:11.102
Presto's doing," Roxy told him.

18
00:01:12.443 --> 00:01:13.564
Detective Smith nodded.

19
00:01:13.584 --> 00:01:16.506
"Yes, I think—" "Help!"

20
00:01:17.366 --> 00:01:18.987
A voice cried out from behind a door.

21
00:01:19.948 --> 00:01:20.909
Roxy looked around.

22
00:01:20.929 --> 00:01:24.691
"That sounded like "Mighty Man!"

23
00:01:25.092 --> 00:01:26.032
said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:27.273 --> 00:01:28.394
Roxy ran to the door.

25
00:01:29.494 --> 00:01:30.175
It was locked.

26
00:01:32.544 --> 00:01:36.506
Whiz-hoo! Roxy blasted it open with her eye laser beams.

27
00:01:37.886 --> 00:01:40.147
The Mighty Man actor was inside a small room.

28
00:01:41.108 --> 00:01:42.308
The TV crew was with him.

29
00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.711
you, Rocket Girl," said the actor.

30
00:01:48.731 --> 00:01:51.472
"No problem," Roxy said.

31
00:01:51.492 --> 00:01:53.313
"Do you know where Mr.

32
00:01:53.373 --> 00:01:54.173
Presto went?"

33
00:01:54.633 --> 00:01:55.574
asked Detective Smith.

34
00:01:55.594 --> 00:01:58.755
"No," said another man.

35
00:01:58.775 --> 00:02:01.076
"He stole a camera and left.

36
00:02:02.344 --> 00:02:04.046
But we can find out what he's doing."

37
00:02:07.188 --> 00:02:08.509
The man turned on a monitor.

38
00:02:10.131 --> 00:02:11.712
Mr. Presto appeared on the screen.

39
00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:16.436
He held a wand in one hand and a microphone in the other.

40
00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:19.619
Metro City Bank was in the background.

41
00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.062
Mr. Presto walked over to a woman.

42
00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:25.864
The woman wore a diamond necklace.

43
00:02:26.825 --> 00:02:28.286
"Hello!" said Mr.

44
00:02:28.306 --> 00:02:30.288
Presto. "What's your name?"

45
00:02:31.324 --> 00:02:32.705
"Molly," said the woman.

46
00:02:32.725 --> 00:02:35.787
"What a lovely name!"

47
00:02:36.168 --> 00:02:36.628
said Mr.

48
00:02:36.668 --> 00:02:40.270
Presto. "I'm going to show you a magic trick, Molly!"

49
00:02:41.071 --> 00:02:42.112
He waved his wand.

50
00:02:42.132 --> 00:02:45.794
"One, two, three Presto!"

51
00:02:46.715 --> 00:02:48.916
Poof! Molly's necklace disappeared.

52
00:02:49.817 --> 00:02:51.358
Mr. Presto looked at the camera.

53
00:02:51.378 --> 00:02:54.220
"Is everyone enjoying my show?"

54
00:02:57.402 --> 00:02:58.043
Next Mr.

55
00:02:58.103 --> 00:02:59.504
Presto walked over to a man.

56
00:03:01.068 --> 00:03:01.868
"Hello, sir!"

57
00:03:02.169 --> 00:03:02.609
said Mr.

58
00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.630
Presto. "Ooh!

59
00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.931
That's a very nice watch you're wearing."

60
00:03:06.951 --> 00:03:10.934
"Uh, thank you," said the man.

61
00:03:10.954 --> 00:03:13.655
"Do you like magic?"

62
00:03:14.156 --> 00:03:14.636
asked Mr.

63
00:03:14.676 --> 00:03:17.618
Presto. "Yes," said the man.

64
00:03:17.638 --> 00:03:20.560
"Watch this," said Mr.

65
00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:23.081
Presto. He waved his wand.

66
00:03:23.882 --> 00:03:26.083
"One, two, three Presto!"

67
00:03:27.484 --> 00:03:29.177
Poof! The watch was gone!

68
00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:32.801
And so was Roxy.

69
00:03:34.263 --> 00:03:35.224
She had to stop Mr.

70
00:03:35.264 --> 00:03:36.506
Presto from stealing things!

71
00:03:37.687 --> 00:03:39.689
Detective Smith was still watching the monitor.

72
00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.813
"Rocket Girl, we need to do something.

73
00:03:43.654 --> 00:03:46.377
Mr. Presto is Rocket Girl?

74
00:03:47.238 --> 00:03:48.059
Where did she go?"
